# 本机设备与签名配置样例。复制成 dm/ios_bringup/local.env（已在 .gitignore 里，不进仓）再填。
# Sample local device and signing configuration. Copy to dm/ios_bringup/local.env (already in .gitignore, not committed) and fill it in.
# 设备标识：xcrun devicectl list devices 的 Identifier 列 | Device identifier: the Identifier column of xcrun devicectl list devices
DM_DEVICE=
# 设备的硬件 UDID（免费账号构建时以这台手机为目标，手机要连着并解锁） | Hardware UDID of the device (with a free account the build targets this phone, which must be connected and unlocked)
DM_IOS_UDID=
# 开发者团队号（Xcode → Settings → Accounts 里团队的 Team ID） | Developer team ID (the Team ID of the team under Xcode → Settings → Accounts)
DM_TEAM_ID=
# App 包名，自己起，反域名写法，如 org.example.bringup | App bundle ID, your own choice, reverse-domain style, e.g. org.example.bringup
BU_BUNDLE_ID=
